@startuml
' 🧱 File: erd.puml
' -----------------
' 📌 Purpose : ERD — PostgreSQL schema for "tasks" table (component-style)
' 🧱 Layer   : Infrastructure / Persistence (Phase 1, Slice 2)
' 👤 Author  : Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Created : 2025-10-19

!define USE_CUSTOM_THEME
!include ../../config/style.puml

title ERD — tasks table (PostgreSQL)

' 🧩 Icons (component diagram context)
FA6_DATABASE(DB, "PostgreSQL DB", component, #E5C55F)
FA6_TABLE(TASKS, "tasks", component, #E2C22F)

DB -[hidden]-> TASKS

' 📋 Columns & Indexes as a note (to avoid class/entity syntax)
note right of TASKS
== Columns ==
- id : uuid [PK]
- title : text
- notes : text (nullable)
- status : int (0=pending,1=done)
- priority : int (0=normal)
- deadline : timestamptz (nullable)
- created_at : timestamptz (default now())
- updated_at : timestamptz (default now())

== Indexes ==
- idx_tasks_status
- idx_tasks_priority
- idx_tasks_deadline
- idx_tasks_status_priority
end note

@enduml
